  "Players.MetavrseBuilder.PlayerGui.GolfMenu.Root.Content.HowToBody.Text: Hold the controller like a putter grip, handle down, and swing through the ball.\nTrigger: warp to your ball\nRight stick: left/right snap turn, forward to teleport, back to rewind your last shot\nLeft stick: walk\nA: re-fit the club (hold it straight down first)\nX: swap hands    B / Y: scorecard\nMenus: point, trigger.  Look at wrist: score + MENU\nSink the ball in as few strokes as you can. 8 strokes max per hole; out of bounds or water costs +1.",
  "Players.MetavrseBuilder.PlayerGui.GolfMenu.Root.Content.HowToBody.Text: Touch near the ball and pull back. Distance sets the power, sideways sets the aim. Let go to putt; slide back to the ball to cancel.\nDrag anywhere else to look around, pinch to zoom.\nButtons: Reset Ball, Scorecard, Explore, Menu.\nExplore: thumbstick to walk, plus Sprint, Fly and Teleport buttons.\nSink the ball in as few strokes as you can. 8 strokes max per hole; out of bounds or water costs +1."
